\par\par \b \uc2 HIGHLIGHTS-HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  twice to curb HK dollar strength\b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2009\par 09:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2 , March 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday as the Hong Kong dollar continued to hit the top end of its trading range with the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 * The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) had sold a total of HK$8.138 billion ($1.05 billion) for U.S. dollars as of 0812 GMT after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice.\par \par \uc2 * The HKMA sold HK$3.1 billion early on Thursday during its first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the day and sold another HK$5.038 billion in the afternoon.\par \par \uc2 * The latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will lift the aggregate balance -- sum of balances on clearing accounts maintained by banks with the HKMA -- to HK$147.18 billion by Monday.\par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong dollar is pegged at 7.8 to the U.S. dollar but can trade between 7.75 and 7.85 to the U.S. dollar. Under the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg, the HKMA is committed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar hits 7.75 or 7.85 to keep the band intact.\par \par \uc2 * The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <HKD=> was quoted at 7.7500/01 against the U.S. dollar at 0816 GMT. (Reporting by Hong Kong newsroom, Editing by Jacqueline Wong)\par \par \uc2 HONGKONG-HKMA/ (HIGHLIGHTS)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|Z|M|D|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090326e53q0013g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
