global markets.\par \par \uc2 *The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is pegged at 7.8 to the U.S. dollar but can trade between 7.75 and 7.85 to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 * In the interbank market, the three-month Hibor <HKD3MD=> was fixed at 0.89286 percent, slightly softer than 0.89571 percent on Monday, the lowest level since late January 2005.\par \par \uc2 The six-month <HKD6MD=> to one-year rates <HKD1YD=> were down 5 basis points from Monday.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The aggregate balance -- a key measure of interbank\par liquidity -- stood at a record HK$175.475 billion on Tuesday. The\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 balance was boosted after a series of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market in the past few months aimed at keeping the Hong Kong dollar within its pegged trading band.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 * Hong Kong dollar forwards were trapped in a narrow range in quiet trades, dealers said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MARKET/ECONOMIC NEWS >Stock market reports and updates: [.HK] >Yuan reports and updates: [CNY/] >U.S. dollar reports and updates: [USD/] [FRX/] >Emerging Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reports and updates: [EMRG/FRX] (Reporting by Christina Lo, Editing by Jacqueline Wong)\f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-HONGKONG-FORWARDS|LANGEN|Table|Z|ABN|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090109e5160009h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
