\par\par \b \uc2 DJ HKMA:  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  To Offset Additional EF Bills Issuance\b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Oktober 2008\par 04:55\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2008, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Monday it bought HK$4.0 billion worth of U.S. dollars to offset new Exchange Fund Bills being issued to make it easier for lenders to borrow from the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The HKMA will issue a total of HK$4 billion worth of three-month Exchange Fund Bills in two upcoming tenders, on Oct. 28 and Nov. 4, to meet strong demand, a spokeswoman said.\par \par \uc2 At 0204 GMT, the U.S. dollar was trading at HK$7.7594, up from HK$7.7578 late Friday.\par \par \uc2 'The issuance of additional Exchange Fund paper will help meet the increased demand for the paper by banks for liquidity management purposes,' HKMA Chief Executive Joseph Yam said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 'Increasing the supply of Exchange Fund paper can also improve banks' access to the discount window and other liquidity facilities recently introduced by the HKMA,' Yam said.\par \par \uc2 The latest injection increases Hong Kong's aggregate balance to HK$14.08 billion from HK$10.09 billion.\par \par \uc2 Under Hong Kong's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system, the Hong Kong dollar is pegged at HK$7.80 to the U.S. dollar but is allowed to trade between HK$7.75 and HK$7.85. -By Jackie Cheung, Dow Jones Newswires; 852-2802-7002; jackie.cheung@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Click here to go to Dow Jones NewsPlus, a web front page of today's most important business and market news, analysis and commentary: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.djnewsplus.com/al?rnd=yd%2Fr9RNC7U%2BZZY%2FtdJdJag%3D%3D"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.djnewsplus.com/al?rnd=yd%2Fr9RNC7U%2BZZY%2FtdJdJag%3D%3D}}}\uc2 . You can use this link on the day this article is published and the following day.\par \par \uc2 -0-\par \par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2008 \uc2 Dow Jones & Company, Inc\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020081020e4ak001bc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
