\par\par \b \uc2 HKMA says no net outflow of HK dollars since May'05  \b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2007\par 10:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG, March 15 (Reuters) - Hong Kong has not seen any net outflow of Hong Kong dollars into foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  since it widened the dollar's trading band in May 2005, the head of the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2  A recent downturn in the local stock market has raised concern that funds could leave the territory and reduce what has been ample liquidity and force interest rates to head higher.  \par \par \uc2  Joseph Yam, chief executive of the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA), the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said in a weekly column posted on the HKMA's Website  {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.info.gov.hk/hkma"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.info.gov.hk/hkma }}}\uc2  that fund outflows could refer to either an outflow of funds from the Hong Kong dollar into foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  or to the movement of money in any \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  out of Hong Kong such as via stocks.  \par \par \uc2  "As far as the Hong Kong dollar is concerned, there has not been any net outflow into foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  since May 2005 after the introduction of refinements to the linked exchange rate system," Yam wrote.  \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar has been pegged at 7.8 to the U.S. dollar for more than two decades. In May 2005, Hong Kong adjusted the mechanism, introducing an upper limit for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , at 7.75, and lowering the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's downside to 7.85.  \par \par \uc2  Under the mechanism the HKMA is required to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves beyond the trading band by buying or selling Hong Kong dollars in exchange for U.S. dollars. However, it can also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying or selling \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollars on a discretionary basis within the trading band.  \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar has been weak recently, hitting an 18-year low at 7.8189 this month, but it has not broken its lower cap at 7.85. Late on Thursday it was trading at 8.8118.     \par \par \uc2 HONGKONG-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 /HKMA|LANGEN|ABN|M|Z|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070315e33f000q8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
